{
  "kanji": "著",
  "completeCard": "---\nkanji: 著\ntitle: write; remarkable\njlpt: 2\ntags: [jlpt-n2, grade-6, structure-unclassified]\nstrokes: 11\nradical: 艸\nradicalNumber: 140\nonyomi: [チョ, チャク]\nkunyomi: [あらわ.す, いちじる.しい]\ndistractors: [者, 署, 春]\n---\n\n# 著 — write; remarkable\n\n**Strokes:** 11 · **Key (radical):** 艸 (no. 140) · **JLPT:** N2 (community list)\n\n## Meaning and origin\n\n著 concerns writing or authorship and conspicuous, remarkable qualities. [著者](../words/著者.md) ちょしゃ is an author; [著す](../words/著す.md) あらわす means write or publish, and 著しい いちじるしい means striking or remarkable.\n\n**Modern-shape mnemonic, not etymology:** Imagine a writer below the plant-like canopy leaving marks that stand out from the page.\n\nThe canonical key is 艸, no. 140, appearing as 艹 above the 者-shaped lower part.\n\n## Readings\n\n| Reading | Type | Typical words |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| チョ | on | [著者](../words/著者.md) ちょしゃ - author |\n| チャク | on | 著する ちゃくする - arrive; reach (sense 1) |\n| あらわ.す | kun | [著す](../words/著す.md) あらわす - write; publish |\n| いちじる.しい | kun | 著しい いちじるしい - striking; remarkable |\n\n## Common words\n\n- [著者](../words/著者.md) ちょしゃ - author; writer\n- [著す](../words/著す.md) あらわす - write; publish a work\n- 著作 ちょさく - writing; literary work\n- 著しい いちじるしい - striking; remarkable\n\n## Notes\n\n- 著する ちゃくする is in the 着する/著する spelling family. Its arrival sense illustrates チャク; do not carry that pronunciation into 著者.\n- JMdict also records 著る as a rare spelling of [着る](../words/着る.md) きる, wear. This is a spelling-specific fact, not a new reading of 著しい.\n- 著す concerns authoring or publishing. The visible [者](者.md) shape alone does not turn every word containing 著 into a word for a person.\n\nMetadata: [KANJIDIC2](https://www.edrdg.org/wiki/index.php/KANJIDIC_Project), 2026-10-21 snapshot. Word pairs: [JMdict](https://www.edrdg.org/wiki/index.php/JMdict-EDICT_Dictionary_Project), entries 1423000, 1427070, 1427080, 1427090, 1427110, 2600680.\n",
